{"id":"n1-041","title":"Noun といわず Noun といわず","romaji":"A to iwazu B to iwazu","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Expresses 'both A and B' or 'be it A or B'; applies to both without distinction.","longExplanation":"The grammar pattern AといわずBといわず means 'be it A or B' or 'both A and B.' It emphasizes that something applies widely, without distinguishing between A and B.","formation":"Noun1 + といわず + Noun2 + といわず + (rest of the sentence)","examples":[{"jp":"冬といわず夏といわず、彼はいつもアイスクリームを食べます。","romaji":"Fuyu to iwazu natsu to iwazu, kare wa itsumo aisukuriimu o tabemasu.","en":"Be it winter or summer, he always eats ice cream.","words":[{"surface":"冬","vocabId":"1446070","reading":"ふゆ"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いわ","vocabId":"1217270","reading":"いわ","baseForm":"いう"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ぬ"},{"surface":"夏","vocabId":"1191320","reading":"なつ"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いわ","vocabId":"1217270","reading":"いわ","baseForm":"いう"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ぬ"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いつも","vocabId":"1188890","reading":"いつも"},{"surface":"アイスクリーム","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"食べます","vocabId":"1358280","reading":"たべます","baseForm":"食べる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3,5,6,7]},{"jp":"老いといわず若きといわず、全ての人がそのイベントを楽しめます。","romaji":"Oi to iwazu wakaki to iwazu, subete no hito ga sono ibento o tanoshimemasu.","en":"Whether old or young, everyone can enjoy that event.","words":[{"surface":"老い","vocabId":"1643510","reading":"おい"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いわ","vocabId":"1217270","reading":"いわ","baseForm":"いう"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ぬ"},{"surface":"若き","vocabId":"1324300","reading":"わかき","baseForm":"若い"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いわ","vocabId":"1217270","reading":"いわ","baseForm":"いう"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":null,"baseFor